~ start
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "neutral", false)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "hoodie", true)
Monk: How lovely!
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "speaking", true)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "hoodie", false)
Plooy: You... [wait=1]You can see Plooy?
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "neutral", false)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "hoodie", true)
Monk: Yes. I have been in this place for... [speed=0.2]eons...
Monk: And to you, “eons” are nothing more than a fickle of dust.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "speaking", true)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "hoodie", false)
Plooy: Time does not seem to work here as intended.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "neutral", true)
Plooy: Has Plooy’s undoing caused more rifts in time?
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "hoodie", true)
Monk: No... you have done the right things. It is “I” [speed=0.5]who stopped time in this stream.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "speaking", true)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "hoodie", false)
Plooy: But why? Why would you do that?
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "neutral", false)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "hoodie", true)
Monk: “Time”, is a river with many eddies...
Monk: The more you move forward in it... the more it pushes against itself.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "speaking", true)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "hoodie", false)
Plooy: A... disagreement?
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "neutral", false)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "hoodie", true)
Monk: Exactly. For every right choice you make, there exists another Plooy — in another timeline — who made the wrong one.
Monk: You must tread carefully. Plooy must not repeat those mistakes... and “I” must not make any more wrong decisions.

do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "no_hoodie", true)
Monk: ...
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "eyes", true)
Monk: ...

do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "speaking", true)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "eyes", false)
Plooy: You’re... [speed=0.2]ME?
Plooy: Wait... These statues... Plooy recognizes them. They look like the lives Plooy has touched.
Plooy: Monk, what are these? What are they doing here?
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "neutral", false)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "no_hoodie", true)
Monk: They are echoes. Nothing more.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "speaking", true)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "no_hoodie", false)
Plooy: Echoes of what?
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "neutral", false)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "no_hoodie", true)
Monk: Of steps taken... and steps yet to be taken...
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "speaking", true)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "no_hoodie", false)
Plooy: Plooy does not understand.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "neutral", false)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "no_hoodie", true)
Monk: You’re not meant to. Not yet.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "speaking", true)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "no_hoodie", false)
Plooy: Are we... [speed=0.5]the cause of the time splits?
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "neutral", false)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "no_hoodie", true)
Monk: [speed=0.5]That is correct. [speed=1.0]“I” must not let you go any further. The heart of time and its pillars must remain like insects in amber.
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "speaking", true)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "no_hoodie", false)
Plooy: We both know that our mistakes will create unpleasant consequences. But even so... we must keep going!
do change_detailed_sprite("plooy", "neutral", false)
do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "no_hoodie", true)
Monk: Very well. But I must remind you, [speed=0.2]“time” [do change_detailed_sprite("monk", "eyes", true)] [speed=1.0]will not always be in your favor.

